a kind of cursed scroll of teleport; it creates a single space cavern 
off in the rock somewhere and teleports you into it. too bad if you 
don't have a wand of digging or a pick-axe.

sometimes, if you're really lucky, the space will be adjacent to a wall 
or a corridor.

perhaps, as a don't-leave-the-player-hopelessly-stuck gesture, the 
scroll could also create a random scattering of half a dozen rock moles, 
who will dig toward you, hopefully digging an escape path.



